 "tamil": {
  "text": "(அரண்மனை. வசந்தசேனை முத்தாரத்தில் உள்ள பதக்கத்துள்ளே மறைத்து வைக்கப்பட்டிருக்கும் உக்ரசேனன் படத்தைப் பார்த்துக் கொண்டிருக்கிறாள்.)\n\n\n\nதோழி : என்னம்மா... தினம் தினம் எதை மறந்தாலும் இதை மறப்பதில்லை நீங்கள்? அப்படியென்ன இந்தப் பதக்கத்தில் கண்ணை இழுக்கும் காந்தம் இருக்கிறது?\n\nவச : காந்தமில்லையடி! ஆபத்தில் கை கொடுக்கும் கடவுள்!\n\nதோ : கடவுளா?\n\nவச : பாரேன்... (படத்தை காட்டுகிறாள்)\n\nதோ : அம்மா, மகாராஜா! வருகிறார்.\n\nபுருஷோத்தமன் : இன்னுமா முடியவில்லை, அலங்காரம்? நேரமாகிவிட்டதே நாடகத்துக்கு...\n\nவசந் : இதோ முடிந்துவிட்டது.\n\nபுரு : மறந்துவிட்டாயா, இன்று மனோகரன் பிறந்தநாள்.\n\nவசந் : மறப்பேனா, செல்வன் பிறந்த நாள்; எனக்கு வேறு ஒரு நினைவு வந்தது...\n\nபுருஷோத் : எது? வசந்தி!\n\nவசந் : நமதுகாதல் விழாவின் பதின்மூன்றாவது ஆண்டு.\n\nபுருஷோத் : ஆமாம் கண்ணே... வருடங்கள் ஓடியதே தெரியவில்லை.\n\n[வந்துகொண்டே வசந்தாவைத் தொடுகிறான்]\n\nவசந்தன் : நெருப்பைத் தொடாதீங்க! சுட்டுவிடும் தேகம்! கொஞ்சம் கொட்டிவிடும் - இதிலெல்லாம் எனக்கு சந்தேகமில்லே...சந்தேகமில்லே.... எப்படியம்மா இன்னிக்கு புதுப்பாடம்? எம்மா!... அடே... அப்பா! அம்மா அழகைப் பாருப்பா... எனக்கும் அம்மாவைப்போல ஒரு பெண்ணு கிடைச்சா...\n\nவசந் : சீ... பேசாமலிரு!\n\nவசந்தன் : பிள்ளையாரு மாத்திரம் கேட்டாரா, அவுங்க அம்மா பார்வதியைப் போல பெண்ணு! நான் கேட்டா என்னப்பா...\n\nபுருஷோத் : தீரவே தீராது இது!\n\n\n\nவசந்தன் : சந்தேகமில்லை.\n\nபுருஷோத் : வசந்தி, நான் போகிறேன்... சீக்கிரம் புறப்படு..."
 },
 "english": {
  "units": [
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u001",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "(Palace. Vasantha Sena is looking at Ugrasena's portrait, hidden inside the pendant on her pearl necklace.)",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "opening-parenthetical-stage-direction",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "description": "Opening palace direction introducing the concealed Ugrasena portrait in Vasantha Sena's pendant."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 10,
       "printed_page": 9
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u002",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "தோழி",
    "text": "Amma... whatever else you may forget day after day, you never forget this, do you? What is there in this pendant that draws your eyes like a magnet?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d001",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u003",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "No magnet, girl! A god who lends a hand in danger!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d002",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The source pivots from the maid's literal `magnet` to Vasantha Sena's metaphorical protector; the abrupt contrast is retained."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u004",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "தோ",
    "text": "A god?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d003",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u005",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Look... (She shows the portrait.)",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d004",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The label-attached source action remains inside the dialogue-linked unit."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u006",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "தோ",
    "text": "Amma, the Maharaja is coming!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d005",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u007",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்தமன்",
    "text": "Still not finished with your adornment? It is already time for the play...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d006",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u008",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்",
    "text": "There—finished.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d007",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u009",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புரு",
    "text": "Have you forgotten? Today is Manoharan's birthday.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d008",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u010",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்",
    "text": "Would I forget—the boy's birthday? Another memory came to me...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d009",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u011",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்",
    "text": "What is it, Vasanthi?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d010",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u012",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்",
    "text": "The thirteenth anniversary of our festival of love.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d011",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u013",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்",
    "text": "Yes, my dear... I did not even notice the years flying by.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d012",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u014",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "[As he comes closer, he touches Vasantha.]",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "bracketed-stage-direction",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "description": "Purushothaman approaches and touches Vasantha before Vasanthan interrupts."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u015",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தன்",
    "text": "Do not touch fire! This body will burn you! It may sting a little too—about all this I have no doubt... no doubt.... What is this, Amma, a new lesson today? Amma!... Hey... Appa! Look at Amma's beauty, Appa... If only I got a girl like Amma...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d013",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The comic return of `சந்தேகமில்லே` from scene 3 is preserved instead of normalized away.",
      "The colloquial Amma/Appa register is retained to keep Vasanthan's teasing voice distinct."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u016",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்",
    "text": "Chi... keep quiet!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d014",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u017",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தன்",
    "text": "Was Pillaiyar the only one who asked for a girl like his mother Parvati? What is wrong if I ask too, Appa...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d015",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "`Pillaiyar` and `Parvati` are retained because the joke depends on the culturally specific comparison."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u018",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்",
    "text": "This will never, ever end!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d016",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 11,
       "printed_page": 10
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The emphatic repetition in `தீரவே தீராது` is reflected in English."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u019",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தன்",
    "text": "No doubt.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-006.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s006-d017",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 12,
       "printed_page": 11
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The brief punchline carries forward the recurring `சந்தேகமில்லை` joke."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s006-u020",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்",
    "text": "Vasanthi, I am going... get ready quickly...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-006.json",
